# Screenshot apps that list windows through ScreenCaptureKit (iShot on macOS 27) see no sharing
# state or alpha, so on the engine they took the never-seen window holding the profile's pages,
# laid over the whole Cra window, and the shot came out blank grey, the page's and the whole
# window's (GitHub #346, 0.1.48). That window is now a 1 pt strip on the window's top edge: the
# pick is the main window over the sidebar, the toolbar and the page alike. The readout reads the
# window list the way such a picker does (cra://debug?screenshotPick).
# promise: #346
budget rss=700 stalls50=5
cra://debug?windowSize=1200x800
wait 1
cra://open?url=${PAGE}?n=whole-window-pick
wait 2
cra://debug?screenshotPick=150,400
expect-log screenshot pick at 150,400: main window
cra://debug?screenshotPick=760,400
expect-log screenshot pick at 760,400: main window
cra://debug?screenshotPick=900,20
expect-log screenshot pick at 900,20: main window
cra://debug?screenshotPick=150,780
expect-log screenshot pick at 150,780: main window
reject-log fault:
